sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Visitor
    participant Widget as ACE Widget
    participant Hub as Identity Hub
    participant Engine as Chat Engine
    participant Interact as ACE Interact

    Visitor->>Widget: Start identification
    Widget->>Hub: Request authentication
    Hub-->>Visitor: Open identity provider
    Visitor->>Hub: Authenticate
    Hub-->>Widget: Identification token
    Widget->>Engine: Submit JWT
    Engine->>Hub: Verify and decrypt token
    Hub-->>Engine: Verified identity data
    Engine->>Interact: Map verified data to contact fields
    Interact-->>Visitor: Agent sees identified contact
